    "preamble": "R.Thangavel vs The Commissioner on 13 March, 2024 Author: B.Pugalendhi Bench: B.Pugalendhi W.P.(Md) No.5 Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated : 13.03.2024 Coram: The Honourable Ms.Justice B.Pugalendhi W.P.(Md) No.5813 of 2024 and W.M.P(Md) Nos.5490 and 5492 of 2024 R.Thangavel ... Petitio Vs. 1.The Commissioner, Tamil Nadu Food Safety and Drug Administration Department, Dms Campus, 5th Floor, No.359, Annasalai, Teynampet, Chennai 600 006. 2.The Designated Officer, Tamil Nadu Food Safety and Drug Administration Department, Food Safety Wing, Office of the Deputy Director of Health Services, Collector Office Campus, Sivagangai District. 3.The Food Safety Officer, Sivagangai Municipality, Sivagangai. __ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ Page 1 of 4 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis W.P.( R.Thangavel vs The Commissioner on 13 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/25609621/ 1 4.The Inspector of Police, Town Police Station, Sivagangai. ... Respon Prayer :- Petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution of I praying for issuance of Writ of Certiorarified Mandamus, to call fo entire records relating to the impugned proceedings in vide under Na.Ka.No.744/A3/2024 dated 28.02.2024 issued by the second respondent and quash the same as illegal and consequently permit th writ petitioner to run petty shop namely M/s.Thangvel Malikai Shop situated at No.37, Indira Nagar, Ilayankudi Salai East, Sivagangai District by unsealing the premises. For Petitioner : Mr.A.Mathan For R1 to R3 : Mr.G.V.Vairam Santhosh Additional Government Ple For R4 : Mr.M.Vaikkam Karunanidhi Government Advocate Order",
